impact__text\">When you choose The Cocoa Circle, you are not just buying cocoa. You are voting for a food system that puts people and planet first.</p>\n    <ul class=\"story-impact__list\">\n      <li><span class=\"story-impact__check\">&check;</span> Direct payments to farmers &mdash; no middlemen</li>\n      <li><span class=\"story-impact__check\">&check;</span> 40 hectares of rainforest actively protected</li>\n      <li><span class=\"story-impact__check\">&check;</span> 100% organic, regenerative farming supported</li>\n      <li><span class=\"story-impact__check\">&check;</span> Community schools and healthcare funded</li>\n      <li><span class=\"story-impact__check\">&check;</span> Carbon-neutral shipping across Europe</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>",
